<title>SINGAPORE: SingTel unit offers new paging service.</title>
<headline>SingTel unit offers new paging service.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Telecom Pagelink Pte Ltd (Pagelink) said in a statement on Tuesday it was investing Singapore $3.0 million in a new message forwarding system.</p>
<p>The services, to be launched on November 21, will allow subscribers to receive faxes through their pagers, forward their pages, speak immediately with the paging party or be connected to a voice mail service, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
